%% Topic: /run-issues auto-clean — label-driven local teardown + issue close
%%
%% Render: mmdc -i run-issues-auto-clean-flow.mmd -o out.svg
flowchart TD
    P[poller.sh tick - Studio only] --> SC[scan_clean repo]
    SC -->|Phase 1: collect unique LOCAL issues, host-gate| L1{run.json host == THIS_HOST or empty?}
    L1 -->|no| SKIP1[skip run-dir]
    L1 -->|yes| COLLECT[add issue_number to seen set]
    COLLECT --> DEDUP[sort -u]
    DEDUP --> L2{Phase 2: gh issue view labels}
    L2 -->|has auto-clean-skipped| SKIP2[skip - already handed to human]
    L2 -->|has auto-clean| EMIT[emit issue repo]
    L2 -->|neither| SKIP3[skip]
    EMIT --> GUARD{tmux has-session run-issues-clean-N?}
    GUARD -->|yes| DEFER[skip - already cleaning]
    GUARD -->|no| CAP{ACTIVE < GLOBAL_MAX?}
    CAP -->|no| BREAK[defer to next tick]
    CAP -->|yes| SPAWN[tmux new-session: auto-clean.sh --repo --issue N]
    SPAWN --> AC[auto-clean.sh]
    AC --> LOCK{lock_issue N acquired?}
    LOCK -->|no - run in progress| RC3[exit 3 - safe retry later]
    LOCK -->|yes| COUNT{count matching run-dirs}
    COUNT -->|0 total - cross-machine| RC5[comment ssh hint + label auto-clean-skipped, exit 5]
    COUNT -->|any completed run completed gt 0| RC4[comment close-PR-first + label auto-clean-skipped, exit 4]
    COUNT -->|all non-completed| TEARDOWN[cleanup-run.sh --repo --issue N --yes]
    TEARDOWN -->|rc != 0| RC6[exit 6 - teardown failed]
    TEARDOWN -->|rc == 0| CLOSE[gh issue close N]
    CLOSE --> COMMENT[comment_issue: situation summary FI]
    COMMENT --> UNLABEL[remove auto-clean label]
    UNLABEL --> RC0[exit 0 - done]
